INSERT INTO RAW_REVIEWS VALUES
('sr001', 'SALON', 'Downtown', '2026-03-20', 5, 'Absolutely love this salon! The colorist was incredibly knowledgeable about my hair type and recommended the perfect shade. The salon is gorgeous and the experience felt luxurious. My hair has never looked better. Will definitely be back!', 'Jennifer M.', 'Premium Hair Color - Golden Brown', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr002', 'SALON', 'Downtown', '2026-03-18', 4, 'Great service overall but had to wait 15 minutes past my appointment time. Once I was in the chair, the colorist did an amazing job with the color. The shade matching consultation was very thorough.', 'Sarah K.', 'Root Touch-Up Service', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr003', 'SALON', 'Midtown', '2026-03-22', 5, 'This was my first visit and I am hooked. The salon team helped me find my perfect shade through the consultation process and the in-person assessment confirmed it. The color came out beautifully — rich, dimensional, and exactly what I wanted.', 'Lisa T.', 'Premium Hair Color - Dark Brown', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr004', 'SALON', 'Midtown', '2026-03-15', 2, 'Disappointed with my experience. The colorist seemed rushed and did not listen when I said I wanted more coverage at the temples. The color is fine but the service was not up to the usual standards. I have been to other locations that were much better.', 'Amanda R.', 'Full Color Service', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr005', 'SALON', 'Westside', '2026-03-10', 5, 'Best salon in the city! The team is so friendly and professional. They really take the time to understand your hair goals. My gray coverage is perfect and the color has lasted over 6 weeks now. Love the subscription option too.', 'Michelle P.', 'Premium Hair Color - Warm Brown', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr006', 'DTC', NULL, '2026-03-19', 5, 'I have been a subscriber for 4 years and the quality never disappoints. The color is consistent box to box, the instructions are clear, and my hair feels healthier than when I used drugstore brands. The subscription makes it so convenient.', 'Rachel B.', 'Premium Hair Color - Medium Brown', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr007', 'DTC', NULL, '2026-03-16', 3, 'The color itself is good but the packaging has changed and the new applicator bottle leaks. Made a mess in my bathroom. The color result was great once applied but the application experience was frustrating. Please fix the bottle!', 'Katie D.', 'Premium Hair Color - Dark Blonde', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr008', 'ULTA', NULL, '2026-03-14', 4, 'Picked this up at Ulta on a whim and was pleasantly surprised. The shade matched my natural color well and covered my few grays. Only issue is the price — it is significantly more expensive than other box colors, so it needs to perform to justify the premium.', 'Diana L.', 'Premium Hair Color - Chestnut', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr009', 'AMAZON', NULL, '2026-03-12', 1, 'The box arrived damaged and the color activator had leaked inside the packaging. By the time I opened it, half the product was unusable. Amazon packaging needs improvement. This is a premium product and deserves better shipping protection.', 'Chris W.', 'Premium Hair Color - Dark Brown', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr010', 'SALLY_BEAUTY', NULL, '2026-03-08', 4, 'Excited to find this brand at Sally Beauty! I have been ordering online but it is nice to pick it up in store. The shade range at Sally is more limited than online though — my exact shade was not available and I had to go with a close alternative.', 'Trish N.', 'Premium Hair Color - Auburn', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr011', 'SALON', 'Northside', '2026-03-20', 5, 'My regular colorist Emily always does an incredible job. She remembers my preferences and adjusts the formula based on how my hair responded last time. This personalized approach is why I keep coming back. The Northside location is beautiful.', 'Margaret H.', 'Full Color + Treatment', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr012', 'SALON', 'Northside', '2026-03-16', 3, 'The color service was fine but the booking system is confusing. I tried to reschedule through the app and ended up double-booked. The front desk handled it gracefully but the tech needs work. Color results were good as always.', 'Janet F.', 'Root Touch-Up Service', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr013', 'SALON', 'Lakewood', '2026-03-19', 5, 'Brought my daughter for her first color experience and the team made it so special. They explained every step, did the shade consultation together, and the result was beautiful and natural. She is already asking when we can go back!', 'Patricia G.', 'Premium Hair Color - Dark Blonde', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr014', 'DTC', NULL, '2026-03-11', 4, 'Switched from another brand and love the quality difference. My hair does not feel fried after coloring. The only reason I am not giving 5 stars is that the color runs a bit darker than the swatch photos online. Consider going half a shade lighter than you think.', 'Anne S.', 'Premium Hair Color - Chestnut', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr015', 'SALON', 'Riverside', '2026-03-21', 1, 'Terrible experience at the Topeka location. The colorist mixed the wrong shade and my hair came out much darker than requested. When I complained, the manager was dismissive and offered only a partial discount on a correction visit. Very disappointing for a premium brand.', 'Karen J.', 'Full Color Service', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr016', 'TARGET', NULL, '2026-03-17', 4, 'Great to have this brand available at Target. Grabbed the Color Therapy mask along with my color kit. The in-store display is helpful for shade matching. Wish they had the full shade range though.', 'Emily V.', 'Premium Hair Color Kit + Color Therapy Mask', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr017', 'WALMART', NULL, '2026-03-13', 3, 'Product quality is fine but the price point feels high for Walmart shoppers. I usually buy drugstore color here and tried this based on ads. Results are noticeably better but at 2x the price, I would need to see even better gray coverage.', 'Donna M.', 'Premium Hair Color - Golden Brown', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr018', 'SALON', 'Downtown', '2026-03-05', 4, 'Love the Downtown location ambiance. Had a gloss treatment today and my hair looks amazing. The only improvement would be offering beverages or snacks during the service — other premium salons do this and it enhances the experience.', 'Nicole R.', 'Color Reviving Gloss', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr019', 'DTC', NULL, '2026-03-22', 5, 'The subscription model is genius. I never run out of color and the auto-ship timing is perfectly calibrated. Plus the packaging is eco-friendly which matters to me. This brand understands their customer.', 'Laura C.', 'Premium Hair Color - Espresso', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP()),
('sr020', 'AMAZON', NULL, '2026-03-09', 4, 'Fast shipping with Prime and the product is authentic. Some reviews mention fakes on Amazon but mine had all the correct packaging and performed exactly as expected. The smell is minimal compared to other permanent colors.', 'Susan H.', 'Premium Hair Color - Golden Brown', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP());
